{"reviews":[{"id":"B00XTW44GM-0","r":2.0,"t":"Not what I thought it was. Read carefully!!!!!","x":"Great smell!! But NOT pure vitamin E and NOT very absorbent. Great for dewy skin but does not absorb easily. I wanted to use it on my face for some scars but it clogged my pores and gave me some tiny little pimples.  Great for legs in the summer but not for anything else. It's not pure and has a bunch of other things I didn't want. I wish I had checked it closer before buying. Will use for the pleasant smell and sheen.","h":13,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2019"},{"id":"B00XTW44GM-1","r":5.0,"t":"This is the best oil! I use it on my face every-night ...","x":"This is the best oil! I use it on my face every-night and my skin has never been better. It has less noticeable wrinkles, less acne and scars are fading.","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2016"},{"id":"B00XTW44GM-2","r":5.0,"t":"Natural oil that smells great","x":"Just purchased this oil to use for scar massage on my son from a recent surgery.  The oil smells lovely and is very smooth. It absorbed well into his skin and did not leave a sticky residue. I like that the ingredients are natural and that it's a usa made product.","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2016"},{"id":"B00XTW44GM-3","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"I love this stuff. It smells great and really helped with my dry spots. Would recommend!!","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2016"},{"id":"B00XTW44GM-4","r":5.0,"t":"Unique product and great for extremely dry skin","x":"This is great to mix in with lotions to give them extra hydration. This is amazing for those extra dry areas of your body and really hydrates any area for a long time. This will be on hand at all times now !","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B00XTW44GM-5","r":5.0,"t":"Love it thanks Jason","x":"I'm 62 year's young and I have used Jason for years and it has worked wonders on my skin. Here is a recent picture of me, look at that gorgeous woman me. \ud83d\ude4b","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2020"},{"id":"B00XTW44GM-6","r":2.0,"t":"I was very annoyed to discover this because I am allergic to almond ...","x":"This is NOT pure vitamin e oil, it is a blend. I was very annoyed to discover this because I am allergic to almond oil, which it contains.","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2017"},{"id":"B00XTW44GM-7","r":5.0,"t":"Great product!","x":"I used this for a scar on my leg. Within a few weeks of using this product it cleared up.Great product!","h":7,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"},{"id":"B00XTW44GM-8","r":5.0,"t":"... used this brand before and it works just as fantastic. Thank","x":"I have never used this brand before and it works just as fantastic. Thank you","h":7,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2016"},{"id":"B00XTW44GM-9","r":5.0,"t":"This is my favorite body oil","x":"This is my favorite body oil! I love the scent and how nourished it makes my skin feel. I use to keep it on hand but I use 2-3 bottles a month and am bummed the price went up so much. I do recommend this though.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B00XTW44GM-10","r":5.0,"t":"Love it!","x":"This is the only product I use on my skin and my baby daughter's skin. It is so smooth and non greasy. Leaves skin super moisturized without feeling greasy or heavy.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"May 2017"},{"id":"B00XTW44GM-11","r":5.0,"t":"No more night creams!","x":"This is the one I will re-buy. I my skin looks amazing.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2016"},{"id":"B00XTW44GM-12","r":5.0,"t":"Great stuff. I don't ever need lotion which I ...","x":"Use it when i am done in the shower before toweling off and skin is still wet. Great stuff. I don't ever need lotion which I have never liked.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B00XTW44GM-13","r":1.0,"t":"No seal on Jason Vitamin E Oil","x":"Product was delivered busted and leaked all over other products in box. No seal was at the top of the bottle and the lid was opened.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2018"},{"id":"B00XTW44GM-14","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Love the smell. Spreads easily. Fantastic. Will buy again","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B00XTW44GM-15","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"Love the concentration of the vitamin E.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2016"},{"id":"B00XTW44GM-16","r":1.0,"t":"The smell was off and nothing like it should smell","x":"This product came already opened with a bunch of the oil leaked out and all over the box and all over my other products! The smell was off and nothing like it should smell! I\u2019m very disappointed in this product! DO NOT BUY IT!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B00XTW44GM-17","r":5.0,"t":"This oil smells devine; it has a refreshingly crisp ...","x":"This oil smells devine; it has a refreshingly crisp smell, that isn't over powering. Its very moisturizing, and is now one of my staple moisturizers","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B00XTW44GM-18","r":3.0,"t":"No seal?","x":"There is no covering over the inside of the bottle and oil leaked all over the inside of the shipping by box. Wasn't sealed at all.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B00XTW44GM-19","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"If feels good on my face, takes make up off easily.  Doesn't clog my pores.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2018"},{"id":"B00XTW44GM-20","r":5.0,"t":"Love","x":"I purchased this to make my homemade lotion. It worked great.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2017"},{"id":"B00XTW44GM-21","r":5.0,"t":"Lovely Oil","x":"Love this oil. I use it all over, including my face. It smooths cuticles instantly. I especially love the almond scent. I just purchased three more.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2016"},{"id":"B00XTW44GM-22","r":5.0,"t":"Smells like marzipan...very nice.","x":"This is really good oil. I put it on at the end of my shower. It smells like marzipan initially, the scent wears off after a few minutes. I love it.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2017"},{"id":"B00XTW44GM-23","r":1.0,"t":"Not good!!","x":"This broke me out in a rash. I had to get Prednisone to feel better. Do a patch test before using!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2016"},{"id":"B00XTW44GM-24","r":5.0,"t":"Love!","x":"I use this as my body lotion and my brown skin has been GLOWING as of late! Love!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"May 2018"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Reviewers frequently praise the pleasant scent of the oil.","cites":[1,3,4,10,15]},{"text":"Many customers report the oil absorbs well and leaves skin moisturized without a greasy or sticky feel.","cites":[3,11,13,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers say it helped with scars, dry spots, and overall skin appearance.","cites":[2,3,4,8,12]},{"text":"Some customers complain the product is not pure vitamin E but a blend, which caused issues like clogged pores or allergic reactions.","cites":[1,7]},{"text":"A few reviewers mention packaging or delivery problems, such as a busted bottle with no seal.","cites":[14]}]},"qa":[]}